{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2022-03-03 07:30:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN AND COX MEDIA GROUP REACH MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT FOR TELEVISION AND AUDIO MEASUREMENT SERVICES', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NIELSEN (NYSE: NLSN) AND COX MEDIA GROUP \xa0ANNOUNCED A MULTI-YEAR RENEWAL AGREEMENT FOR TELEVISION AND AUDIO MEASUREMENT SERVICES COVERING COX MEDIA GROUP LOCAL TELEVISION STATIONS IN 10\xa0FULL SERVICE TELEVISION MARKETS AND COX MEDIA GROUP LOCAL RADIO STATIONS IN 10 FULL SERVICE RADIO MARKETS. WITH THIS AGREEMENT, COX MEDIA GROUP STATIONS WILL CONTINUE TO UTILIZE A COMPREHENSIVE SUITE OF NIELSEN MEASUREMENT SERVICES TO DEMONSTRATE AUDIENCE VALUE TO ADVERTISERS.'}